Ah, ok.  I will have to wait until February 12-13 to really know
what the best times are for me, that being the time that I get
together with my other community members and we set our calendar
for the year.

The time period of July or August is easier for me than Spring,
so if you don't want to wait until mid-February to set the date,
I have a higher chance that a random date works.

I want to hear from other people too.  Have you not spoken up for
lack of interest, for lack of there being a concrete plan, or secret
reason #3?

